DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
6413::$$$message_0047_0000_0000$$$::I take the forest path to the hills behind the temple.[lr]::
6414::$$$message_0047_0000_0001$$$::The weather is nice today. Once I'm through this curtain of trees, I should get a good view of the mountains and the clear blue sky.::
6415::$$$message_0047_0001_0000$$$::My field of vision opens up.[lr]::
6416::$$$message_0047_0001_0001$$$::I'm greeted by a spectacular mound of debris.[lr]::
6417::$$$message_0047_0001_0002$$$::But I'm not the one looking at this abstract scene.[lr]::
6418::$$$message_0047_0001_0003$$$::It's Shirou Emiya, a man with the same origin as me, chanting an unpleasant sutra.::
6419::$$$message_0047_0002_0000$$$::The white sunlight is blindingly bright.[lr]::
6420::$$$message_0047_0002_0001$$$::Summer hasn't left Ryudou Temple quite yet.[lr]::
6421::$$$message_0047_0002_0002$$$::"Agh, so bright..."[lr]::
6422::$$$message_0047_0002_0003$$$::I must have been dazzled by the sunlight.[lr]::
6423::$$$message_0047_0002_0004$$$::For an instant, the scene appears black instead of white, like a film negative.::
6424::$$$message_0047_0003_0000$$$::He must've noticed me by now, but he doesn't turn my way.[lr]::
6425::$$$message_0047_0003_0001$$$::I thought the dizziness was making me see things, but the sight must have been quite real to him.[sestop time=2000 nowait=true]::
6426::$$$message_0047_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
6427::$$$message_0047_0004_0001$$$::We both gaze out, silently.[lr]::
6428::$$$message_0047_0004_0002$$$::Both of us saw the same thing,[lr]::
6429::$$$message_0047_0004_0003$$$::but my verbal reaction proves my impurity.[lr]::
6430::$$$message_0047_0004_0004$$$::The chirping of insects nearby only accentuates my tension.::
6431::$$$message_0047_0005_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
6432::$$$message_0047_0005_0001$$$::I watch his familiar rear profile.[lr]::
6433::$$$message_0047_0005_0002$$$::Speaking of which, why isn't he in his usual red outfit?[lr]::
6434::$$$message_0047_0005_0003$$$::I'd understand if he was trying to avoid the sweltering summer heat, but it's already autumn. He's not the kind of person who would disarm himself just for the weather either.::
6435::$$$message_0047_0006_0000$$$::Either way, this sunshine is grating on me.[lr]::
6436::$$$message_0047_0006_0001$$$::This is a favorite spot of mine. Having so many interruptions makes me want to pick a fight.[wm canskip=0]::
6437::$$$message_0047_0007_0000$$$::"...Hey.[lr]::
6438::$$$message_0047_0007_0001$$$::Weren't you wearing that same outfit in some high place before?"[lr]::
6439::$$$message_0047_0007_0002$$$::I recall the eventual pain of being shot through the head.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
6440::$$$message_0047_0007_0003$$$::"I was. So what? I didn't see you around there."::
6441::$$$message_0047_0008_0000$$$::"I bet you didn't. I've never seen you out at night. I just felt like I did."[lr]::
6442::$$$message_0047_0008_0001$$$::Still, everything that's possible has to happen.[lr]::
6443::$$$message_0047_0008_0002$$$::I'll either defeat him or be defeated.[lr]::
6444::$$$message_0047_0008_0003$$$::However that turns out, I'll just make the choice that works out the best for me at the time.::
6445::$$$message_0047_0009_0000$$$::"...Let me ask you something, then. Have you been going out on patrol with Saber at night?"[lr]::
6446::$$$message_0047_0009_0001$$$::"Yeah. We haven't gone as far as Shinto yet."[lr]::
6447::$$$message_0047_0009_0002$$$::We literally [font italic=true]can't[font italic=false] make it that far, to be exact.::
6448::$$$message_0047_0010_0000$$$::"I wouldn't, if I were you. Don't go to Shinto at night. If you try to cross the bridge from Miyama then, you'll be going out of your way for an ambush."[lr]::
6449::$$$message_0047_0010_0001$$$::"Huh? What, are you keeping people out?"[lr]::
6450::$$$message_0047_0010_0002$$$::"All of Shinto is within my range.[lr]::
6451::$$$message_0047_0010_0003$$$::Anyone who enters gets a warning shot."::
6452::$$$message_0047_0011_0000$$$::Apparently, he's already driven off several Servants.[lr]::
6453::$$$message_0047_0011_0001$$$::That's why Lancer, Rider, and Caster can't go near Shinto at night.[lr]::
6454::$$$message_0047_0011_0002$$$::Lancer's supposed to be staying at the church, but he's probably camping in the hills, too.[lr]::
6455::$$$message_0047_0011_0003$$$::Setting that aside for now...::
6456::$$$message_0047_0012_0000$$$::"...Huh. Does that go for me, too?"[lr]::
6457::$$$message_0047_0012_0001$$$::"You're an exception. I'll shoot you between the eyes."[lr]::
6458::$$$message_0047_0012_0002$$$::He isn't lying.[lr]::
6459::$$$message_0047_0012_0003$$$::Archer's bloodlust is genuine. I can feel it.::
6460::$$$message_0047_0013_0000$$$::"Man, I can't believe you're still trying to kill me. Are you trying to take advantage while Tohsaka isn't around?"[lr]::
6461::$$$message_0047_0013_0001$$$::"That goes without saying. Things get complicated when Rin is around. She's the type of Master who hates fighting pointless battles, though that's not to say she doesn't enjoy combat."::
6462::$$$message_0047_0014_0000$$$::I sure agree with that.[lr]::
6463::$$$message_0047_0014_0001$$$::Tohsaka likes winning, but she doesn't seek out conflict. She's the kind of person who will try to come out on top, but only once someone else starts the race.::
6464::$$$message_0047_0015_0000$$$::"She probably wouldn't let you do what you want, if she were here.[lr]::
6465::$$$message_0047_0015_0001$$$::She'd wait to see who fires the opening shot of this renewed war.[lr]::
6466::$$$message_0047_0015_0002$$$::...Actually, I haven't asked you this yet: [lr]::
6467::$$$message_0047_0015_0003$$$::What do you think of all this, Archer?"::
6468::$$$message_0047_0016_0000$$$::"I don't intend to fight in the war as a Servant.[lr]::
6469::$$$message_0047_0016_0001$$$::But she did trust me to keep an eye on things, so I won't just ignore what's happening."::
6470::$$$message_0047_0017_0000$$$::"...Uh-huh. You're just a little more aggressive than the others, then. But you still want to fix this, just like me."[lr]::
6471::$$$message_0047_0017_0001$$$::"As loath as I am to admit it, yes. That's why I'm not fully armored right now. This isn't my war to fight."[lr]::
6472::$$$message_0047_0017_0002$$$::I see. That explains it.[lr]::
6473::$$$message_0047_0017_0003$$$::Archer's reluctantly doing the bare minimum to keep a lid on things, given that Tohsaka asked him to hold down the fort while she's gone.::
6474::$$$message_0047_0018_0000$$$::"So can I take that to mean you won't be throwing your hat in the ring? You're just going to play the righteous peacekeeper of Shinto, and all that?"[lr]::
6475::$$$message_0047_0018_0001$$$::"Yeah. But I'll make an exception for you.[lr]::
6476::$$$message_0047_0018_0002$$$::...I don't even need to wait for night to fall. Why don't we kill each other right here, right now?"::
6477::$$$message_0047_0019_0000$$$::Archer responds to my hostility.[lr]::
6478::$$$message_0047_0019_0001$$$::I smirk, as if to imply I'd been waiting for this moment...[lr]::
6479::$$$message_0047_0019_0002$$$::"...Just kidding. I don't want to fight here, either.[lr]::
6480::$$$message_0047_0019_0003$$$::Plus, if we're going to drag out this Holy Grail War, then it's gotta be at night."[lr]::
6481::$$$message_0047_0019_0004$$$::...and deflect his threat.::
6482::$$$message_0047_0020_0000$$$::"Let's leave it at that.[lr]::
6483::$$$message_0047_0020_0001$$$::See ya around, Archer."[lr]::
6484::$$$message_0047_0020_0002$$$::I leave.[lr]::
6485::$$$message_0047_0020_0003$$$::"...Very well. When it comes to you, I'm dead serious.[lr]::
6486::$$$message_0047_0020_0004$$$::If the Holy Grail War is back, then I'll do whatever it takes to kill you both."::
6487::$$$message_0047_0021_0000$$$::His voice carries both provocation and determination.[lr]::
6488::$$$message_0047_0021_0001$$$::Archer intends to fight me and Saber.[lr]::
6489::$$$message_0047_0021_0002$$$::   Bring it on. I'll see you once you're ready.[lr]::
6490::$$$message_0047_0021_0003$$$::I dismiss his heavy-handed bloodlust with lofty resolve.[lr]::
6491::$$$message_0047_0021_0004$$$::We've handed each other invisible challenges to duel to the death.[lr]::
6492::$$$message_0047_0021_0005$$$::It's a license for each of us to kill the other.::
906418::$$$message_9047_0001_0003$$$::It's Shirou Emiya, a man with the same origin as me, chanting an unpleasant sutra.[r]::

